        "hero_age_066=0",
        "hero_birthplace_066=0",
        "hero_hate_066=0",
        "hero_zm_066=我叫墨茗，這把弓是我登記的靈裝，上面自帶燈光哦。",
        "hero_chat1_066=0",
        "hero_chat2_066=0",
